  "Specification": "Byzantine Paxos consensus proof (BPConProof). A PlusCal specification with TLA+ translation for Byzantine fault-tolerant consensus. Models acceptors, leaders, and fake acceptors sending 1a/1b/1c/2av/2b messages. Defines Byzantine quorum assumptions, invariants (TypeOK, 1bInv1/2, 2avInv1/2/3, maxBalInv, accInv, knowsSentInv), and proves Spec => []Inv and refinement of PConProof via INSTANCE with PmaxBal substituted for maxBal.",
